{"data": [{"author_id": "813509341500280832", "created_at": "2026-11-11T22:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120637700059566515"], "id": "2120637700059566515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Mientras la terapia con CRISPR para la anemia falciforme llega a más lugares, hay una pastilla que va por el mismo camino.. desde hace casi 30 años...", "url": "https://x.com/carlodelasancha/status/2120637700059566515"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:51:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120635472238305788"], "id": "2120635472238305788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10 kbのMYC遺伝子座を塩基対の解像度で網羅するーーほぼPAMレスのSpRY-Cas9タイリング変異導入が見つけた、創薬標的候補の超保存RNAエレメント\n[Cell誌論文から]\nhttps://t.co/JclJuI7mz3\n#CRISPR HF1-SpRY-Cas9を介して発見し、立体障害型のASOでターゲッティング", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2120635472238305788"}, {"author_id": "1594334462866853888", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:47:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120634600892547149"], "id": "2120634600892547149", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120558700054102372", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Take my gloves off, ill give you real-time read and write of DNA transcription without zero CRISPR. 😘 https://t.co/mIrFMvyJsX", "url": "https://x.com/XREVOemag/status/2120634600892547149"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:50:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120635397424451600"], "id": "2120635397424451600", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CRISPR mutagenesis of the MYC locus reveals a druggable ultraconserved RNA element.\nCell. 2026-11-04 (online).\nShi P. Yang F, Tala Fnu T [..] Que J, Wu X.\nhttps://t.co/qoQSIrB2Fn\n#CRISPR", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2120635397424451600"}, {"author_id": "1874427045381304320", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:46:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120634193164095945"], "id": "2120634193164095945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Thank a Vet Day for defending this amazing country. \nUS Medical advances from 1890 (life expectancy 45) to 2024 (life expectancy 79)\nX-rays\ninsulin\nblood banks\npenicillin\npolio &amp; MMR vaccines\norgan transplants\nopen-heart &amp; valve surgery\nDNA\nCheckpoint inhibitors\nCRISPR\nmany more", "url": "https://x.com/well_maybe_not/status/2120634193164095945"}, {"author_id": "904089105256067072", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:59:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120637589212295477"], "id": "2120637589212295477", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Partículas similares a virus mejoran la entrega de CRISPR en modelos de cerdo y pollo\n\nhttps://t.co/Xw6FCrbtlc https://t.co/Pgqq1DqFww", "url": "https://x.com/cienciasuy/status/2120637589212295477"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:50:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120635288255140037"], "id": "2120635288255140037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "コンパクトCas9の通説を覆す：Sequence Displayからの高品質かつ大規模な「配列ー活性」データとタンパク質言語モデルの統合によりSlugCas9のPAM制約を大きく緩和\n[Nat Commun論文から]\nhttps://t.co/TE7Evz6gNZ\n#CRISPR: SpCas9より約25%小型（1,054アミノ酸）なStaphylococcus lugdunensis", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2120635288255140037"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "813509341500280